TITLE Calcite kinetic reaction with acidic solution at 200 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
    -water 1
KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 1.0 10.0
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 1000 in 100
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -time true
    -step true
    -totals Alkalinity
END
